During every [[battle]], the player must deploy '''Cat Units''' (also known as just '''Cats''') in order to defeat [[Enemy Units]] and destroy their base. The [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Basic Cat]] is the only Cat Unit available at the start of the game, but more can be unlocked by playing [[Cat Capsule]]s or beating stages. As of {{CurrentVer}}, there are over 800 different Cat Units.

